Package: rtw89-custom
Version: @VERSION@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), build-essential
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Maintainer: dan1165 <dan1165@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/dan1165/rtw89-custom
Description: Out-of-tree rtw89 driver for the RTL8851BU, regulatory unlock on
 Built from the upstream rtw89 tree with every optional code path compiled in
 (debugfs, dynamic debug, WoW, monitor, injection) and the regulatory unlock
 enabled by default: all channels the chip supports, no DFS/CAC, no NO-IR, and
 a TX power boost. Built through DKMS against the running kernel.
 .
 Set unlock_regd=0 txpwr_boost=0 at load time for the conforming behaviour.
